  "translation": "Na olgeta ol bikman i salim ⟨את⟩ Yehudi, pikinini bilong Netanya, pikinini bilong Shelemayahu, pikinini bilong Kushi, i go long Baruk, ol i tok olsem:_skrol we yu ridim long en long ol au bilong ol manmeri, kisim ⟨em⟩ long han bilong yu na kam. Na Baruk, pikinini bilong Nerya, i kisim ⟨את⟩ skrol long han bilong en, na i kam long ol.",
